{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 多智能体系统MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"多智能体系统的生产部署考量\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"多智能体系统\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> advanced\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/多智能体\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/advanced</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">多智能体系统MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"多智能体系统的生产部署考量\" dir=\"auto\">多智能体系统的生产部署考量</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">请详细说明将多智能体系统部署到生产环境需要考虑的关键因素，包括可观测性、容错机制、性能优化、成本控制等。</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>生产部署的核心挑战</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">多Agent系统从Demo到生产需要解决可靠性、可观测性、安全性和成本控制四大挑战。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>1. 可观测性架构</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 多Agent系统的可观测性设计</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> opentelemetry <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> trace\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> opentelemetry<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>exporter<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>otlp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>proto<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>grpc<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>trace_exporter <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> OTLPSpanExporter\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ObservableAgent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"可观测的Agent基类\"\"\"</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> name<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> name\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tracer <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> trace<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get_tracer<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"agent.</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>name<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>metrics <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"llm_calls\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"tool_calls\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"errors\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"latency_ms\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">execute</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">with</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tracer<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>start_as_current_span<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"agent.</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">.execute\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> span<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            span<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>set_attribute<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"agent.name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            span<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>set_attribute<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"task.type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n            start_time <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> time<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>time<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">try</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_do_execute<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                span<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>set_attribute<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"result.status\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"success\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> result\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">except</span> Exception <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> e<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                span<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>set_attribute<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"result.status\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"error\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                span<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>set_attribute<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"error.message\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>e<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>metrics<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"errors\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">raise</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">finally</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                latency <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>time<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>time<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> start_time<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token number\">1000</span>\n                self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>metrics<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"latency_ms\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>latency<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                span<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>set_attribute<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"latency_ms\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> latency<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>关键监控指标：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标类别</th>\n<th>具体指标</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>性能</strong></td>\n<td>Agent响应延迟</td>\n<td>单个Agent的执行时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>端到端任务完成时间</td>\n<td>整个工作流的执行时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>吞吐量</td>\n<td>单位时间处理的任务数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>质量</strong></td>\n<td>任务成功率</td>\n<td>成功完成的任务比例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>LLM调用次数</td>\n<td>每个任务的LLM调用次数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>幻觉率</td>\n<td>输出中包含错误信息的比例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>成本</strong></td>\n<td>Token消耗</td>\n<td>每个任务的总Token消耗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>API调用成本</td>\n<td>实际的API调用费用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>工具调用次数</td>\n<td>外部工具的调用频率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>健康</strong></td>\n<td>Agent活跃度</td>\n<td>各Agent的在线状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>错误率</td>\n<td>各类错误的发生频率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>队列深度</td>\n<td>待处理任务的积压情况</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>2. 容错机制</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> tenacity <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> retry<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> stop_after_attempt<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> wait_exponential\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ResilientAgent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"具备容错能力的Agent\"\"\"</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@retry</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n        stop<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>stop_after_attempt<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        wait<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>wait_exponential<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>multiplier<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">min</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">4</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">max</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">10</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        retry<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>retry_if_exception_type<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>LLMError<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> TimeoutError<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">call_llm</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"LLM调用带重试\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>ainvoke<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">execute_with_fallback</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"带降级策略的执行\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">try</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 尝试主模型</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>execute<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> model<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-4\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">except</span> Exception<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">try</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token comment\"># 降级到备用模型</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>execute<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> model<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-3.5-turbo\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">except</span> Exception<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token comment\"># 最终降级：返回结构化错误</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"status\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"failed\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"error\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"所有模型调用失败\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">circuit_breaker_execute</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"断路器模式\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>circuit_breaker<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>is_open<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"status\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"circuit_open\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"error\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"服务熔断\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">try</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>execute<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>circuit_breaker<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>record_success<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> result\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">except</span> Exception <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> e<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>circuit_breaker<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>record_failure<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">raise</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>3. 性能优化策略</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>模型分层</strong></td>\n<td>简单任务用小模型，复杂任务用大模型</td>\n<td>成本降低40-60%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>结果缓存</strong></td>\n<td>缓存常见查询结果</td>\n<td>减少重复LLM调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>并行执行</strong></td>\n<td>无依赖的Agent并行运行</td>\n<td>端到端时间减少50%+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>异步IO</strong></td>\n<td>所有外部调用异步化</td>\n<td>提高并发处理能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>流式输出</strong></td>\n<td>实时返回部分结果</td>\n<td>改善用户体验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>批量处理</strong></td>\n<td>聚合多个小请求批量调用</td>\n<td>降低API开销</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>4. 成本控制</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">CostController</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"多Agent系统的成本控制\"\"\"</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> budget_limit<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">float</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>budget_limit <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> budget_limit\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>current_spend <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>alerts <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">check_budget</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> estimated_cost<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">float</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">bool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"检查是否超出预算\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>current_spend <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> estimated_cost <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>budget_limit<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>alerts<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"budget_exceeded\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"current\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>current_spend<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"estimated\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> estimated_cost<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"limit\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>budget_limit\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">False</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">select_model_by_budget</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> task_complexity<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"根据预算选择模型\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> task_complexity <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"simple\"</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">and</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>budget_remaining<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-3.5-turbo\"</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 预算紧张时用便宜模型</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">elif</span> task_complexity <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"complex\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-4\"</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 复杂任务必须用强模型</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-3.5-turbo\"</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 默认用经济模型</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>生产部署检查清单：</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-markdown\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-markdown is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">□ 可观测性\n  □ 全链路Tracing\n  □ 关键指标监控\n  □ 日志聚合与分析\n  □ 告警配置\n\n□ 容错\n  □ 重试机制\n  □ 断路器\n  □ 降级策略\n  □ 状态持久化\n\n□ 安全\n  □ 身份认证\n  □ 权限控制\n  □ 输入输出过滤\n  □ 审计日志\n\n□ 性能\n  □ 异步执行\n  □ 缓存策略\n  □ 模型分层\n  □ 批量处理\n\n□ 成本\n  □ Token预算控制\n  □ 模型路由\n  □ 用量监控\n  □ 自动扩缩容\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问1</strong>：多Agent系统的状态持久化如何实现？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：使用LangGraph的Checkpoint机制定期保存状态；使用PostgreSQL/Redis持久化关键状态；设计幂等的Agent节点以便重试；使用消息队列保证任务不丢失。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问2</strong>：多Agent系统的自动扩缩容策略？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：基于队列深度和Agent负载自动调整实例数；设置最小/最大实例数限制；使用Kubernetes HPA自动扩缩容；冷启动优化确保快速扩容。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：生产部署就是把开发环境的代码放到服务器上。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：生产部署需要考虑容错、监控、安全、成本等多个维度。开发环境的Agent跑在内存中，进程一杀就没了；生产环境的业务流程可能跨越数天甚至数周，必须有完善的持久化和恢复机制。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<blockquote dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>总结</strong>：本文共整理了24道关于主流Agent框架和多智能体系统的面试题，涵盖LangChain核心架构、LangGraph状态图、CrewAI角色协作、AutoGen对话编排、LlamaIndex RAG、框架对比选型、Multi-Agent架构设计、A2A协议、安全治理和生产部署等全部重要知识点。每道题目包含详细答案、代码示例、延伸追问和常见误区，适合系统性的面试准备和技术学习。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%A4%9A%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9FMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">多智能体系统MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}